{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43168","headline":"送张兵曹赴营田 · 魏兼恕","name":"送张兵曹赴营田","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"河曲今无战，王师每务农。\n选才当重委，足食乃深功。\n草色孤城外，云阴绝漠中。\n萧关休叹别，归望在乘騘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"魏兼恕","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43168.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43168","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}